and do nothing with your repentance.

714
01:58:37.906 --> 01:58:40.906
Someone paid a very high price for it.

715
01:58:40.906 --> 01:58:45.906
Someone died for you on a cross not only to save you...

716
01:58:45.906 --> 01:58:49.906
but to save the world around you through you.

717
01:58:49.906 --> 01:58:51.906
People, we must take action.

718
01:58:51.906 --> 01:58:55.906
If we see what we heard from this wonderful man just in that video...

719
01:58:55.906 --> 01:58:58.906
that more and more people are coming to repentance...

720
01:58:58.906 --> 01:59:02.906
we must be ready to help these people in good works.

721
01:59:02.906 --> 01:59:07.906
Be helpful in giving clothing to the poor.

722
01:59:07.906 --> 01:59:10.906
Be helpful in giving your testimony.

723
01:59:10.906 --> 01:59:14.906
Be helpful in going on a missionary trip.

724
01:59:14.906 --> 01:59:17.906
Be helpful in building God's kingdom.

725
01:59:17.906 --> 01:59:21.906
But let your evangelism be shown through the good works that you have...

726
01:59:21.906 --> 01:59:23.906
in the name of Jesus.

727
01:59:23.906 --> 01:59:25.906
I believe I am almost through.

728
01:59:25.906 --> 01:59:27.906
And the last one is this.

729
01:59:27.906 --> 01:59:32.906
And I called that ecclesiological evangelism.

730
01:59:32.906 --> 01:59:35.906
Difficult word. I was also googling how...

731
01:59:35.906 --> 01:59:39.906
how do I say this correctly? Ecclesiological evangelism.

732
01:59:39.906 --> 01:59:42.906
I wanted to include the word ecclesia...

733
01:59:42.906 --> 01:59:45.906
because ecclesia means the gathering.

734
01:59:45.906 --> 01:59:47.906
And that is what I wanted to include.

735
01:59:47.906 --> 01:59:50.906
You can also call it church evangelism.

736
01:59:50.906 --> 01:59:52.906
And I will read that out loud.

737
01:59:52.906 --> 01:59:56.906
Acts 2 verse 46 and 47 says...

738
02:00:23.906 --> 02:00:26.906
The people who believed in Jesus came together.

739
02:00:26.906 --> 02:00:28.906
So the church is being formed.

740
02:00:52.906 --> 02:00:56.906
And the Lord made the group of people who were saved...

741
02:00:56.906 --> 02:00:58.906
every day greater.

742
02:00:58.906 --> 02:01:00.906
Lastly, I want to say...

743
02:01:00.906 --> 02:01:04.906
if you think it is a good methodology...

744
02:01:04.906 --> 02:01:06.906
to bring people to repentance...

745
02:01:06.906 --> 02:01:08.906
by calling them to the church...

746
02:01:08.906 --> 02:01:11.906
then I want to say that. Yes, the church is ready.

747
02:01:11.906 --> 02:01:14.906
For those people who do not yet know Jesus...

748
02:01:14.906 --> 02:01:17.906
to tell them about the love of God.

749
02:01:17.906 --> 02:01:19.906
The church is ready for that.

750
02:01:19.906 --> 02:01:21.906
The church is perfectly suited for that.

751
02:01:21.906 --> 02:01:24.906
But do you know who is a better evangelist?

752
02:01:24.906 --> 02:01:25.906
Yourself.

753
02:01:25.906 --> 02:01:28.906
Because it is actually better to first tell someone...

754
02:01:28.906 --> 02:01:30.906
about the love of God...

755
02:01:30.906 --> 02:01:33.906
and then see if their heart opens up.

756
02:01:33.906 --> 02:01:35.906
And if that heart opens up...

757
02:01:35.906 --> 02:01:37.906
to then take them to the church.

758
02:01:37.906 --> 02:01:39.906
I have experienced it before...

759
02:01:39.906 --> 02:01:41.906
that I took people to the church...

760
02:01:41.906 --> 02:01:44.906
who out of favor said to me as a person...

761
02:01:44.906 --> 02:01:46.906
I come to take a look at the church.

762
02:01:46.906 --> 02:01:48.906
It makes absolutely no sense.

763
02:01:48.906 --> 02:01:50.906
If that heart is still closed to the gospel...

764
02:01:50.906 --> 02:01:52.906
people can come and sit here in the church...

765
02:01:52.906 --> 02:01:54.906
and they think to themselves...

766
02:01:54.906 --> 02:01:55.906
those people are really crazy.

767
02:01:55.906 --> 02:01:57.906
They stand here with their hands in the air...

768
02:01:57.906 --> 02:02:00.906
watching a video, hallelujah, waving in heaven.

769
02:02:00.906 --> 02:02:03.906
It's strange for someone who has not yet received Jesus.

770
02:02:03.906 --> 02:02:05.906
So it is better to evangelize...

771
02:02:05.906 --> 02:02:07.906
in the place where you are...

772
02:02:07.906 --> 02:02:09.906
and then in the preparatory work...

773
02:02:09.906 --> 02:02:11.906
you take them to church.

774
02:02:11.906 --> 02:02:12.906
Shall we stand?

775
02:02:12.906 --> 02:02:14.906
Because I am going to close this service.

776
02:02:14.906 --> 02:02:16.906
I know it was a quick sermon...

777
02:02:16.906 --> 02:02:18.906
but I had to do that because of that video...

778
02:02:18.906 --> 02:02:20.906
that I wanted to include.

779
02:02:20.906 --> 02:02:23.906
So I would like to give you some homework now.

780
02:02:23.906 --> 02:02:26.906
Maybe we can, some people start to walk...

781
02:02:26.906 --> 02:02:28.906
unless you really don't need to walk.

782
02:02:28.906 --> 02:02:30.906
Shall we pause for a moment?

783
02:02:30.906 --> 02:02:32.906
Because I want to conclude this service in prayer.

784
02:02:32.906 --> 02:02:34.906
I just want to ask you...

785
02:02:34.906 --> 02:02:37.906
please think for yourself...

786
02:02:37.906 --> 02:02:39.906
who you are?

787
02:02:39.906 --> 02:02:42.906
Because I want us as a church, I want to mobilize us...

788
02:02:42.906 --> 02:02:45.906
to be the church of evangelism.

789
02:02:45.906 --> 02:02:47.906
Can we close our eyes?

790
02:02:48.906 --> 02:02:50.906
Let's all close our eyes.

791
02:02:54.906 --> 02:02:56.906
Lord...

792
02:02:57.906 --> 02:02:59.906
in the name of Jesus in this building...

793
02:02:59.906 --> 02:03:02.906
there must be so much power present...

794
02:03:02.906 --> 02:03:04.906
and potential...

795
02:03:04.906 --> 02:03:08.906
that we can turn the whole world upside down.

796
02:03:08.906 --> 02:03:10.906
That we can turn the Kempen upside down...

797
02:03:10.906 --> 02:03:11.906
for the love of Jesus.

798
02:03:11.906 --> 02:03:14.906
It should be possible with the people who are here.

799
02:03:15.906 --> 02:03:18.906
If twelve apostles could go into the world...

800
02:03:18.906 --> 02:03:20.906
and turn the world upside down...

801
02:03:20.906 --> 02:03:22.906
how should three hundred people in this room...

802
02:03:22.906 --> 02:03:26.906
not be effective for the Kempen?

803
02:03:26.906 --> 02:03:29.906
And Lord, I want to bring us all before your throne.

804
02:03:29.906 --> 02:03:30.906
Lord, I want to ask you...

805
02:03:30.906 --> 02:03:34.906
help us Lord to break free from conformity.

806
02:03:34.906 --> 02:03:37.906
Help us Lord to break free from...

807
02:03:37.906 --> 02:03:41.906
getting stuck in the routine of life.

808
02:03:41.906 --> 02:03:44.906
having accepted Jesus, we may have once been enthusiastic...

809
02:03:44.906 --> 02:03:46.906
about the love of Jesus...

810
02:03:46.906 --> 02:03:50.906
but over the years it has indeed become quieter.

811
02:03:50.906 --> 02:03:52.906
Lord, I want to ask you, Holy Spirit...

812
02:03:52.906 --> 02:03:55.906
make our hearts warm.

813
02:03:55.906 --> 02:03:58.906
Mobilize our tongues...

814
02:03:58.906 --> 02:04:02.906
so that we start talking about the love of Jesus.

815
02:04:02.906 --> 02:04:05.906
For those people in this room who have shame...

816
02:04:05.906 --> 02:04:07.906
yes, I will not talk about Jesus...

817
02:04:07.906 --> 02:04:08.906
we will not think of them.

818
02:04:08.906 --> 02:04:12.906
Lord, help us to overcome this shame.

819
02:04:12.906 --> 02:04:15.906
Take it away from us.

820
02:04:15.906 --> 02:04:17.906
Give us an easy situation...

821
02:04:17.906 --> 02:04:20.906
through your Holy Spirit, a no-brainer.

822
02:04:20.906 --> 02:04:23.906
Lord, that we may see people come to repentance...

823
02:04:23.906 --> 02:04:27.906
or that we may testify to people about the love of Jesus...

824
02:04:27.906 --> 02:04:28.906
and that we will start to see...

825
02:04:28.906 --> 02:04:32.906
how easy it actually is to talk about Jesus.

826
02:04:32.906 --> 02:04:34.906
And that will give us joy...

827
02:04:34.906 --> 02:04:36.906
for how wonderful it is to be able to bring the light...

828
02:04:36.906 --> 02:04:39.906
to a dark world.

829
02:04:39.906 --> 02:04:40.906
Lord, I want to ask you...

830
02:04:40.906 --> 02:04:43.906
if you would also grant us a measure of forgiveness...

831
02:04:43.906 --> 02:04:45.906
for the times we have been indifferent...

832
02:04:45.906 --> 02:04:48.906
about this topic of evangelism.

833
02:04:48.906 --> 02:04:50.906
It is so important in a dying world...

834
02:04:50.906 --> 02:04:53.906
that we tell the good news of Jesus.

835
02:04:53.906 --> 02:04:54.906
That we simply cannot sit still.

836
02:04:54.906 --> 02:04:57.906
We just cannot make that choice.

837
02:04:57.906 --> 02:04:59.906
Lord, help me.

838
02:04:59.906 --> 02:05:03.906
Help my brothers and sisters in this room.

839
02:05:03.906 --> 02:05:04.906
That we will take it seriously...

840
02:05:04.906 --> 02:05:06.906
that Jesus died on a cross.

841
02:05:06.906 --> 02:05:07.906
That we will take it seriously...

842
02:05:07.906 --> 02:05:10.906
that the world needs Jesus.

843
02:05:10.906 --> 02:05:14.906
That peace is only possible through Jesus.

844
02:05:14.906 --> 02:05:16.906
Help us, Lord.

845
02:05:16.906 --> 02:05:18.906
For those people in this room...

846
02:05:18.906 --> 02:05:20.906
who have seen a certain ministry...

847
02:05:20.906 --> 02:05:22.906
in those six points that I just read out...

848
02:05:22.906 --> 02:05:26.906
I want to challenge you through the Holy Spirit.

849
02:05:26.906 --> 02:05:29.906
That you will receive the assignment from God...

850
02:05:29.906 --> 02:05:32.906
to which He has called you.

851
02:05:32.906 --> 02:05:34.906
If you have been a bit lost on the street...

852
02:05:34.906 --> 02:05:37.906
and it keeps you awake because you are still afraid...

853
02:05:37.906 --> 02:05:40.906
then I break that fear in the name of Jesus...

854
02:05:40.906 --> 02:05:43.906
so that you can go out in Jesus' name.

855
02:05:43.906 --> 02:05:44.906
If you need wisdom...

856
02:05:44.906 --> 02:05:47.906
because you feel that you want to engage in debate...

857
02:05:47.906 --> 02:05:49.906
with unbelieving people...

858
02:05:49.906 --> 02:05:52.906
I declare that you will receive wisdom...

859
02:05:52.906 --> 02:05:54.906
from the Holy Spirit.

860
02:05:54.906 --> 02:05:57.906
The testimony of who you are.

861
02:05:57.906 --> 02:05:59.906
Lord, I want to ask you...

862
02:05:59.906 --> 02:06:01.906
to make the testimony clear...

863
02:06:01.906 --> 02:06:03.906
in the hearts of the people.

864
02:06:03.906 --> 02:06:05.906
Who was I again?

865
02:06:05.906 --> 02:06:07.906
And who am I now?

866
02:06:07.906 --> 02:06:10.906
That is your story in the name of Jesus.

867
02:06:10.906 --> 02:06:14.906
And believe me, your story is effective for other people.

868
02:06:14.906 --> 02:06:17.906
And so I bless in the name of Jesus...

869
02:06:17.906 --> 02:06:19.906
that we all may be called...

870
02:06:19.906 --> 02:06:22.906
to be evangelists for God's kingdom.

871
02:06:22.906 --> 02:06:24.906
In the mighty name of Jesus.

872
02:06:24.906 --> 02:06:26.906
And we all say amen.

873
02:06:26.906 --> 02:06:28.906
Amen and amen.

874
02:06:30.906 --> 02:06:33.906
Dear ladies, it is women's night soon.

875
02:06:33.906 --> 02:06:35.906
See the agenda in the app.

876
02:06:35.906 --> 02:06:37.906
And I must warn everyone...

877
02:06:37.906 --> 02:06:39.906
we are going to close the summer camps.

878
02:06:39.906 --> 02:06:43.906
The registrations for the summer camps will close on June 15.

879
02:06:43.906 --> 02:06:45.906
And we will enforce this strictly.

880
02:06:45.906 --> 02:06:48.906
Because if we don't, we will keep fumbling.

881
02:06:48.906 --> 02:06:50.906
So on June 15 we will close the registration...

882
02:06:50.906 --> 02:06:52.906
and you can no longer sign up.

883
02:06:52.906 --> 02:06:55.906
So please register your children and your teenagers.

884
02:06:55.906 --> 02:06:56.906
God bless you.

885
02:06:56.906 --> 02:06:58.906
And go with the love of God.

886
02:06:58.906 --> 02:07:00.906
We have ooiesoep in the bar.

887
02:07:00.906 --> 02:07:02.906
So smell nice together.
